  characterId: pentatuttulu
  displayName: PENTATUTTULU
  subtitle: Stretch, Bounce, Poyon
  role: STRETCH
  flavorText: 'A fluffy, cloud-white visitor from somewhere far away.

    Its arms
    and legs stretch farther than you think,

    and it bounces off what it stomps
    on.

    Nobody knows where it came from.'
